# Employee Attrition Prediction — Machine Learning

## Objective
Explore employee attrition data and build a machine-learning workflow for identifying patterns associated with employee exits.

## Intended Workflow
**Data acquisition → preprocessing → exploratory analysis → feature preparation → model training → evaluation → deployment**

## Focus Areas
- Data preprocessing
- Exploratory analysis
- Feature preparation
- Model comparison/tuning
- Practical deployment considerations

## Portfolio Note
This project is retained as an ML learning project; the README now clearly separates the documented methodology from future implementation steps rather than implying unsupported results.

## Tech Stack
**Python | Pandas | Scikit-learn | Machine Learning | EDA**